WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Match the order and its state
Check the workspace. Match the order number and invoice, then read
payment and shipment states independently. One purchase can contain
several separately fulfilled vendor orders.

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Inspect delivery configuration or parcels
Check the workspace. Match the order, carrier, tracking reference and
recorded events. A missing carrier or arrival time needs follow-up; it
is not delivery confirmation.

3
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:36.000
Separate physical and financial work
Check the workspace. Match the return to its order and current stage.
Receipt, inspection, restocking and financial refund are distinct
decisions; use the next permitted action.

4
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Read the refund trail
Check the workspace. Match the order, amount, destination and state. A
pending refund is not settled; return approval alone does not prove
money was returned.

